    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1158">

                <pb facs="0957" n="947" xml:id="pg947"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Manhard, Philip W.: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Peiping</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Clubb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-18T11:00:00+08:00">March 18 [<hi
                                rendition="#italic">17?</hi>], 1949—11 a. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 17—11:56 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Unnumbered. Re Contel 296, March 16 [<hi rendition="#italic">17?</hi>].<anchor
                        n="30" xml:id="d1158-f1"/> Manhard and Armstrong applied March 17 Public
                    Safety Bureau for permission proceed Mukden. Informed reply would be made in due
                    course.</p>
                <p>Deptel 80, February 16 and Embtel 55, February 18<anchor n="31" xml:id="d1158-f2"
                    /> noting impossibility [<hi rendition="#italic">improbability</hi>] early
                    assignment, does Department’s authorization send Chinese messenger still
                    hold?</p>
                <p>Sent Department; repeated Shanghai 300, for info Nanking, OffEmb Canton.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clubb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1158-f1" n="30" xml:id="d1158-f1-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1158-f2" n="31" xml:id="d1158-f2-content">
                <p>Latter is the same as telegram No. 412 from the Ambassador in China, <ref
                        target="#pg937">p. 937</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
